translation.en:
October of last year, of the 21st of January of this year, and of the agreement made orally with the interested parties on that account, a term stands today for the taking up of the purchase contract agreed between the Prince of Hohenlohe-Ingelfingen and the Bank Director Leixner at Frankfurt a/O. concerning the estates Kolno and Kaemen, of the Posen district. At this term there appeared

1, on the part of the seller

a, as his agent the councillor of justice Melzer, who legitimates himself by the special power of attorney already in the records and granted to him for this act;

b, the general agent of the Prince, the building councillor Glenck, already personally known to the undersigned;

